ी कमी करू शकशील का?"}, {"pack": "business", "key": "counter_offer", "register": "informal", "fr": "Je te propose 9 euros l'unité.", "text": "मी तुला प्रति नग 9 युरो देतो."}, {"pack": "business", "key": "deal", "register": "formal", "fr": "Marché conclu !", "text": "व्यवहार पक्का झाला!"}, {"pack": "business", "key": "deal", "register": "informal", "fr": "Ça marche, c'est d'accord !", "text": "ठीक आहे, ठरलं!"}, {"pack": "business", "key": "change_clause", "register": "formal", "fr": "Nous aimerions modifier cette clause.", "text": "आम्हाला हे कलम बदलायचे आहे."}, {"pack": "business", "key": "currency", "register": "informal", "fr": "Tu veux payer en quelle monnaie ?", "text": "कोणत्या चलनात पैसे द्यायचे आहेत?"}, {"pack": "business", "key": "shipped", "register": "informal", "fr": "Ta commande est partie.", "text": "तुझी ऑर्डर पाठवली गेली आहे."}, {"pack": "business", "key": "best_regards", "register": "formal", "fr": "Bien cordialement.", "text": "आपला नम्र."}]